  definition:
    version: 1
    kind: 0
    id: archive-b29
    title: "Kay\u0131t B-29"
    description: "Uyar\u0131 devresinin eski kayd\u0131n\u0131 yeniden \xFCret. Kayd\u0131n
      iki tepkisinin bi\xE7imini, g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC ve aralar\u0131ndaki aral\u0131\u011F\u0131
      g\xF6zlemle."
    rules:
      minParts: 3
      maxParts: 10
      minSamples: 1
      maxSamples: 3
      maxDepth: 10
      traceCount: 2
      parts:
      - itemID: pulse-source
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 1
        explanation: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7: 0,18 an\u0131nda tek uyar\u0131m yollar.
          Y\xFCkseklik 1; giri\u015F yok, bir \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F."
      - itemID: pulse-n12
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "Tek ba\u015F\u0131na denendi\u011Finde ince ve k\u0131sa bir
          iz b\u0131rak\u0131r. Uyar\u0131n\u0131n geli\u015F an\u0131n\u0131 ve
          g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC korur."
      - itemID: pulse-meter
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 1
        explanation: "Sonu\xE7: bir veya iki giri\u015Ften gelen izleri ayn\u0131
          kayda \xE7izer. \xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yok."
      - itemID: pulse-splitter
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "Gelen her izi iki \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131na da iletir.
          Her \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa ayr\u0131 bir hat ba\u011Flan\u0131r."
      - itemID: pulse-delay
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "\u0130\xE7inden ge\xE7en tepki daha sonra g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr.
          Geni\u015Flik ve g\xFC\xE7 de\u011Fi\u015Fmez; tekrar kullan\u0131l\u0131rsa
          bekleme uzar."
      - itemID: pulse-attenuator
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "\u0130\xE7inden ge\xE7en tepkiyi s\xF6n\xFCkle\u015Ftirir.
          \u0130z ayn\u0131 yerde ve ayn\u0131 geni\u015Flikte kal\u0131r; tekrarlamak
          onu daha da zay\u0131flat\u0131r."
      - itemID: pulse-n34
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "Tepkiyi geni\u015F bir iz haline getirir. Uyar\u0131n\u0131n
          geli\u015F an\u0131n\u0131 ve g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC korur."
      - itemID: pulse-n08
        allowed: 1
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "Gelen tepkiyi k\u0131sa ve s\xF6n\xFCk bir iz haline getirir.
          Tek ba\u015F\u0131na N-12'den daha zay\u0131f g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
      - itemID: pulse-n21
        allowed: 0
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "K\u0131sa bir tepki b\u0131rak\u0131r; yan\u0131t\u0131 normal
          numuneden sonra gelir. Bu bekleme, geciktiricinin beklemesinden daha k\u0131sad\u0131r."
      - itemID: pulse-n46
        allowed: 0
        minimum: 0
        maximum: 4
        explanation: "Her uyar\u0131ya aral\u0131kl\u0131 iki yan\u0131t verir. Yan\u0131tlar\u0131n
          bi\xE7imini ve g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC korur; tek giri\u015F ve tek \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131
          vard\u0131r."
