    notes:
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "\u0130letim g\xF6zlemi"
      explanation: "Bir i\u015Flem, kendi i\xE7inden ge\xE7en tepkileri de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir.
        Ba\u015Fka bir hatta ilerleyen tepki, bu i\u015Flemden etkilenmez."
      blocks: []
    - pageIndex: 0
      title: "Kay\u0131t kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131"
      explanation: "\xD6nce her numunenin tek ba\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131
        izi tan\u0131. Sonra eski kay\u0131ttaki tepkilerle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r;
        hedefin \xE7izdi\u011Fi ba\u011Flant\u0131y\u0131 de\u011Fil, davran\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131
        yeniden olu\u015Ftur."
